  "contract": "⑫ (lines_pack §4): HalloweenService sends today's line (Config.Halloween.Banter, KST day = floor((SeasonNow - DayOneStart) / 86400) + 1 clamped 1..9) as Args.Banter of the <Key>Appear broadcast, formatted 'Short: \"line\"'. The Day 9 Ghost King line is filled FIRST with this server's beaten kings (memory only; a king that goes home does not count; none -> GhostKingZero), then formatted. Game dev 1's Announce shows Args.Banter as the next chat line in the event's Color (no toast).",
  "limitations": "The chat line itself is game dev 1's (Announce.luau: Args.Banter -> a second system message, same color, no toast). The schedule loop is not run; DebugSpawn uses the same appear / finish code."
